<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="et">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<title>Saba Sozashvili, veebiprogrammeerimine</title>
	<style>img { max-width: 400px; height: auto; }</style>
</head>
<body>
	<img src="../pics/veebiprogrammeerimine_2026_AA.png" alt="banner">	
	<h1>Eesti film</h1>
	<p>Siin saab lisada uue filmi.</p>

	<ul>
		<li><a href="/">Avalehele</a></li>
		<li><a href="/eestifilm">Eesti filmi avalehele</a></li>
	</ul>
	<hr>
	<h2>Lisa film</h2>
	<form method="POST">
		<label for="titleInput">Filmi pealkiri</label>
		<input id="titleInput" name="titleInput" type="text" placeholder="Pealkiri" value="<%= titleInput %>">
		<br>
		<label for="releaseYearInput">Väljaande aasta</label>
		<input id="releaseYearInput" name="releaseYearInput" type="number" placeholder="1978" value="<%= releaseYearInput %>">
		<br>
		<label for="durationMinutesInput">Kestus minutites</label>
		<input id="durationMinutesInput" name="durationMinutesInput" type="number" placeholder="90" value="<%= durationMinutesInput %>">
		<br>
		<label for="descriptionInput">Filmi lühikirjeldus</label>
		<br>
		<textarea id="descriptionInput" name="descriptionInput" rows="4" cols="50"><%= descriptionInput %></textarea>
		<br>
		<input id="movieSubmit" name="movieSubmit" type="submit" value="Salvesta film">
	</form>
	<p><%= notice %></p>
	<hr>
</body>
</html>